6c）记录了探针连续失败及 503 状态码；Elasticsearch 日志（fact-0f3c1662d382 等聚合事实）明确记录了 `message: \"dependency unavailable\"` 且伴随 `http_status: 503`；Deepflow 流量记录（fact-654b0841c714 等聚合事实）也证实了该 Pod 接收到的请求被原样返回 503。\n- 此行为导致 Pod 被标记为 `NotReady`（fact-4d372253b7a0），从而将流量隔离，并在用户侧表现为应用直接报错。由于内存消耗为 0 且无重启，可排除运行时故障或资源争抢。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 82.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 82.1s (Evidence 75.5s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 114.471, "metrics": {"run_id": "c684a4528e3d4713", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 114.47900819778442, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 114479.00819778442, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 72608.80661010742, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 90929.98600006104, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 41339.00332450867}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17724.78175163269, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 82056.01453781128, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14676.340103149414, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

